# EndspielZero game v1
# The torus showcase: a short tactical melee in which nearly every move crosses a glued
# edge, so the shape-follow choreography is exercised from the first move. The line is
# plain engine chess - there is no toroidal literature to borrow a famous game from - so
# it was generated from the engine's own legal moves with a capture-preferring rule and
# verified legal move by move. The opener 1. Qd5 is a queen capture across the rank seam;
# the rooks then trade through the file seam and the bishops wrap diagonally.
variant torus
variant_id 12057290357954865990
start 8/8/8/rnbqkbnr/pppppppp/8/PPPPPPPP/RNBQKBNR w - - 0 1
move d1d5
move e5d5
move h1h5
move a5a1
move c1g5
move c5g1
move f1b5
move f5b1
move g5h4
move d5e6
move b5c4
move e6d7
move h5h8
move g1h8
